WEBVTT

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:04.016
really anything that's provided a source
of creative inspiration.

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:05.776
And she writes,

00:11:05.800 --> 00:11:10.040
"The box means I never
have to worry about forgetting.

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:13.816
One of the biggest fears
for a creative person

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:16.296
is that some brilliant idea will get lost

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:19.800
because you didn't write it down
and put it in a safe place.

00:11:20.920 --> 00:11:22.696
I don't worry about that.

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:25.080
Because I know where to find it.

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:27.640
It's all in the box."

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:31.616
You can manage many ideas like this,